rectangle "==OpenRouter\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>\n\nFree-tier frontier-class models. Reached ONLY by the gateway, over direct TLS with certificate verification — there is no cleartext hop and no sandbox ever talks to it." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxTb2Z0d2FyZSBTeXN0ZW0sRXh0ZXJuYWw=>> as OpenRouter

rectangle "Agentic Platform (local)\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-QWdlbnRpYyBQbGF0Zm9ybSAobG9jYWwp>> {
  hexagon "==Agent Gateway\n<size:16>[Container: agentgateway (workshop: same)]</size>\n\nLAB 3/4 control point. Owns WHICH TOOLS an agent can see and call. Because tool calls now cross a network they are interceptable — lab 4 spends that." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsQ29udHJvbFBvaW50>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.AgentGateway
  rectangle "==Identity Provider\n<size:16>[Container: Keycloak (workshop: Amazon Cognito)]</size>\n\nIssues JWTs carrying a `groups` claim. The ENTIRE Cognito coupling this replaces was two strings (issuer, JWKS) and one claim name: cognito:groups -> groups." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsSWRlbnRpdHk=>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.IdentityProvider
  hexagon "==Code-Exec Broker\n<size:16>[Container: Python, FastMCP (workshop: same)]</size>\n\nLAB 5 control point. The model picks a period/region; the BROKER builds the scoped, parameterized query. Raw rows enter the sandbox as a FILE, never through the LLM context; the chart returns as bytes behind a short chart_id the model cannot dereference." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsQ29udHJvbFBvaW50>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.CodeExecBroker
  hexagon "==Code Sandbox\n<size:16>[Container: gVisor via RuntimeClass + upstream agent-sandbox (workshop: Kata + Firecracker)]</size>\n\nRuns model-written pandas air-gapped and single-use: claim, run, destroy, pool refills. No network, no Kubernetes token. Own kernel — verified the workshop's own way, uname -r returns 4.19.0-gvisor." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsU2FuZGJveA==>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.CodeSandbox
  hexagon "==Coding-Agent Dispatcher\n<size:16>[Container: Python, FastAPI (workshop: same)]</size>\n\nLABS 6-7 control point. Mints a per-run git token and revokes it after; claims a sandbox; and holds the push credential so the MODEL never does — Claude is told to commit, not to push." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsQ29udHJvbFBvaW50>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.CodingAgentDispatcher
  hexagon "==Coding Sandbox\n<size:16>[Container: gVisor + Claude Code (workshop: Kata/Firecracker + Claude Code)]</size>\n\nRuns the real `claude -p` CLI, unpatched. Egress locked to exactly two in-cluster destinations; no standing credential; no service-account token." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsU2FuZGJveA==>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.CodingSandbox
  rectangle "==Customer Agent\n<size:16>[Container: Python, Strands Agents SDK, FastAPI]</size>\n\nAgent loop: picks tools, calls the model, streams SSE. agent.py/server.py run VERBATIM from the workshop." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsQWdlbnQ=>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.CustomerAgent
  hexagon "==AI Gateway\n<size:16>[Container: Envoy AI Gateway (workshop: same, fronting Bedrock)]</size>\n\nLAB 0 control point. Owns WHICH model answers: agents ask for an alias, the gateway rewrites it to a real model. Also the only thing that would hold a model credential." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsQ29udHJvbFBvaW50>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.AIGateway
  rectangle "==Local Model Runtime\n<size:16>[Container: Ollama (workshop: Amazon Bedrock)]</size>\n\nServes qwen3:8b and llama3.2:1b over an OpenAI-compatible API. Runs on the HOST, not in the cluster, because that is where the GPU is." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsTW9kZWw=>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.LocalModelRuntime
  hexagon "==OTel Collector\n<size:16>[Container: OpenTelemetry Collector (workshop: same)]</size>\n\nLAB 2 control point. Every workload speaks plain OTLP here and holds NO credential for the tracing backend — one key to rotate. Also where telemetry is SHAPED: a filter rule drops the per-SSE-chunk spans that took one trace from 543 spans to 9." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb250YWluZXIsQ29udHJvbFBvaW50>> as AgenticPlatformlocal.OTelCollector
}

AgenticPlatformlocal.CustomerAgent --> AgenticPlatformlocal.AIGateway <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Chat completions, asking for the ALIAS 'local-smart'\n<size:16>[HTTP, OpenAI wire format]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.CustomerAgent --> AgenticPlatformlocal.AgentGateway <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "list_tools at session start, then tool calls\n<size:16>[MCP / StreamableHTTP]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.AgentGateway --> AgenticPlatformlocal.IdentityProvider <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Fetches JWKS, validates every token (mode: Strict)\n<size:16>[HTTP]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.AIGateway --> AgenticPlatformlocal.LocalModelRuntime <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Rewrites alias -> qwen3:8b, forwards\n<size:16>[HTTP, OpenAI wire format]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.CustomerAgent --> AgenticPlatformlocal.OTelCollector <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Spans, zero tracing code — opentelemetry-instrument patches httpx + FastAPI\n<size:16>[OTLP/HTTP]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.AIGateway --> AgenticPlatformlocal.OTelCollector <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Spans. Needed appProtocol: grpc on the collector Service — without it Envoy speaks gRPC over HTTP/1.1 and the receiver rejects every stream while reporting nothing\n<size:16>[OTLP/gRPC]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.AIGateway --> OpenRouter <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Same hop, different backend — a config change, not a code change. Direct TLS, system trust store, via BackendTLSPolicy\n<size:16>[HTTPS]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.CustomerAgent --> AgenticPlatformlocal.CodeExecBroker <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "run_python(period, region) — gated to the sales-analyst persona\n<size:16>[MCP via the agent gateway]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.CodeExecBroker --> AgenticPlatformlocal.CodeSandbox <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Uploads rows + generated code as FILES, executes, reads back, destroys\n<size:16>[HTTP, single-use]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.CodingAgentDispatcher --> AgenticPlatformlocal.CodingSandbox <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Claims a sandbox, uploads the task, runs claude -p\n<size:16>[HTTP, single-use]</size>"
AgenticPlatformlocal.CodingSandbox --> AgenticPlatformlocal.AIGateway <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Anthropic Messages format — the gateway translates to OpenAI and holds the key\n<size:16>[HTTPS]</size>"

@enduml